# Target bonus — Acme offer letter (Dana Reyes)

> Module Incentive_comp_acme

Source: SYN-014 § 2.2 (offer letter, 2026-01-15).

```catala-metadata
declaration scope IncentiveCompAcme:
  input annual_base_salary content money
  output target_bonus_rate content decimal
  output target_bonus content money
```

## SYN-014 § 2.2 — target annual bonus

  Target annual bonus: fifteen percent (15%) of your annual base salary, payable in March
  following the performance year, subject to Acme's achievement of company targets and
  your continued employment through the payment date.

The conditions on payment ("achievement of company targets") are judgments, not rules:
they stay in the vector store. Only the rate is encoded.

```catala
scope IncentiveCompAcme:
  definition target_bonus_rate equals 15%
  definition target_bonus equals annual_base_salary * target_bonus_rate
```
